      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wasuka emagcekeni aseMowabi, waya entabeni yaseNebo, engqongeni yasePisiga emaqondana leJeriko. INkosi yamtshengisa lonke ilizwe, elakoGileyadi laze lafika kwelakoDani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lonke elakoNafitali, lelakoEfrayimi lelakoManase, lonke ilizwe lakoJuda kwaze kwaba soLwandle lwasentshonalanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leNegebi, legceke eliyisigodi saseJeriko, umuzi wamalala, kwaze kwaba seZowari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuye: Yilo leli ilizwe engafunga kuAbrahama loIsaka loJakobe ngathi: Ngizakulinika inzalo yenu. Sengikuvumele ukuba ulibone ngamehlo akho, kodwa kawuyikuwela uye kilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 12:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose inceku yeNkosi wafela khona elizweni laseMowabi njengelizwi leNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walahlwa esigodini elizweni laseMowabi maqondana leBeti‐Peyori; kodwa kakho olaziyo iliba lakhe kuze kube lamuhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wayeleminyaka elikhulu lamatshumi amabili ekufeni kwakhe. Amehlo akhe ayengafiphalanga, lamandla akhe ayengaphelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakoIsrayeli bamlilela uMose emagcekeni aseMowabi insuku ezingamatshumi amathathu; zaphelake insuku zokumkhalela lokumlilela uMose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa indodana kaNuni wayegcwele umoya wokuhlakanipha, ngoba uMose wayebekile izandla zakhe phezu kwakhe. Ngakhoke abantu bakoIsrayeli bamlalela, benza njengalokhu iNkosi imlayile uMose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selokhu kwaba yilesosikhathi kakuvelanga umprofethi onjengoMose koIsrayeli, iNkosi eyazana laye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.33.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 33:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngazo zonke izibonakaliso lezimangaliso iNkosi eyamthumela ukuba azenze elizweni laseGibithe, kuFaro lakuzo zonke inceku zakhe lakulo lonke ilizwe lakhe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "langamandla amakhulu langezenzo ezinkulu ezesabekayo azenzayo uMose phambi kwabo bonke abakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
